Closes https://github.com/httpwg/http-extensions/issues/2834.

A client can express its interest in digests using `Want-Repr-Digest` during upload creation. The server can then respond with `Repr-Digest` after POST and PATCH requests to share its digest with the client. The client computes its digest as well during the upload and compares the digest to spot issues. The representation digest of an upload resource covers the entire bytes that have been uploaded so far (i.e. right until the upload offset).

